          "question": "How often should it be checked?",
          "answer": "I can help with that, but I need to know what you mean by \"it.\" Which of these are you asking about?\n\n- Blood pressure\n- Blood glucose (blood sugar)\n- Cholesterol\n- A screening test (please name it)\n- Something else (please name it)\n\nIt would also help to know whether you have a specific reading or result, or whether you have a diagnosis for this condition. For example, \"my blood sugar was 7.2 mmol/L\" or \"I was diagnosed with high blood pressure\" would let me give more relevant background.\n\nI can't see your results or medical history, so the answer will be general. Your clinician can tell you how often you should be checked, based on your own situation.\n\nNot medical advice. This is an educational software project. It does not diagnose or treat, and it must not be used for real medical decisions.",
